#. module: mrp_bom_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_bom_tracking.field_mrp_bom__days_to_prepare_mo
msgid ""
"Create and confirm Manufacturing Orders this many days in advance, to have "
"enough time to replenish components or manufacture semi-finished products."
msgstr ""
"Kreiraj i potvrdi radne naloge ovoliko dana unaprijed kako bi bilo dovoljno "
"vremena za nabavu komponenti ili proizvodnju polugotovih proizvoda."

#. module: mrp_bom_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_bom_tracking.field_mrp_bom__days_to_prepare_mo
msgid "Days to prepare Manufacturing Order"
msgstr "Dani za pripremu naloga za proizvodnju"

#. module: mrp_bom_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_bom_tracking.field_mrp_bom__consumption
msgid ""
"Defines if you can consume more or less components than the quantity defined on the BoM:\n"
"  * Allowed: allowed for all manufacturing users.\n"
"  * Allowed with warning: allowed for all manufacturing users with summary of consumption differences when closing the manufacturing order.\n"
"  Note that in the case of component Highlight Consumption, where consumption is registered manually exclusively, consumption warnings will still be issued when appropriate also.\n"
"  * Blocked: only a manager can close a manufacturing order when the BoM consumption is not respected."
msgstr ""
"Definira možete li potrošiti više ili manje komponenti od količine definirane na sastavnici:\n"
"  * Dopušteno: dopušteno za sve proizvodne korisnike.\n"
"  * Dopušteno s upozorenjem: dopušteno za sve proizvodne korisnike uz sažetak razlika u potrošnji pri zatvaranju radnog naloga.\n"
"  Imajte na umu da će se u slučaju komponente Highlight Consumption, gdje se potrošnja bilježi isključivo ručno, i dalje izdavati upozorenja o potrošnji kada je potrebno.\n"
"  * Blokirano: samo voditelj može zatvoriti radni nalog kada potrošnja na sastavnici nije poštovana."

